  "journal": {
    "caravan": {
      "title": "Defend the Caravan",
      "text": "On the road to Eldervale we fell in with a merchant caravan. The merchants say people have been disappearing, animals will not cross certain bridges, and raiders are taking advantage. Then the raiders came: two at the front, two down off the ridge, and their leader last of all. We held the road and he ran. One crate in the caravan is sealed with a faded six-point emblem; it came from a ruined trading post and was bound for Eldervale."
    }
  }
